# What Plan2001 takes from MicroPython (github.com/micropython/micropython,
# tag v1.27.0, commit 78ff170de9e32c79db6e64d3e33d2bd60002bdcd), for
# tools/importmp, into sys/src/cmd/micropython: the interpreter's core, the
# REPL's line editor and runner, two headers the core includes.  The port
# around them is Plan2001's own (docs/mpinit.md).
#   PATH        a file or a whole directory, from MicroPython's root
#   !PATH       not that (inside a directory above)
# A file this repo already has is Plan2001's own and is never overwritten.
